    st.write("What followed was a journey from football fields to NASCAR pit crews to the country music stage — and the lessons that came with it.")
    st.write("In this episode of The Turf: Powered by D1, Chase and host Will Bartholomew talk toughness, leadership, mentorship, loss, and what it really means to reinvent yourself when the dream you built your life around disappears.")

